{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d14f0c1bb34eaeb92c19ccbe6b365227.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a horror adventure game in which a girl who misses her best friend searches for her in an aquarium that has turned into a terrifying world.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game by exploring the aquarium map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the aquarium map to progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a number of mysteries in the aquarium that must be solved in order to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/487822ae396b690d2c539c3f0fed1f43.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're at risk of being attacked and killed by strange creatures called Creepies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d0e55f0ea5b668250c7c9df1cdb7dde2.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And enjoy inspiring stories with the characters you meet at the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/78ffa4b0d77684d0508e8aef24331eae.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you willing to overcome your biggest fear in order to save your best friend? Navigate your way through an aquarium overrun by gruesome creatures known as creepies and unravel its hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d87776065f1d440a65551c072aa0173f.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>Originally released in February 2024 as a free-to-play game, this revamped version of The Aquarium does not dance includes the following updates: <br> <br>- All five heroines are now fully voiced! <br>- A brand-new scenario titled &quot;The Aquarium will always hunger&quot; <br>- An updated and brand-new UI design plus event CG <br>- Full English localization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/ca5c777168f62e1e5fe0e268d9f8e096.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/1d8c3ec8d71f609d9b586356a97dcaa6.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having been gifted a premium pass to Bianca Aquarium, Suze and her best friend, Lulu, receive a guided tour of the place led by the aquarium director\u2019s charming wife, Chrissy. However, when Lulu suddenly goes missing, Suze goes looking for her and inexplicably finds herself in a strange and terrifying world that looks nothing like the aquarium she was at just moments ago.   <br>   <br>While searching the aquarium, now overrun with gruesome sea creatures, a mysterious armed woman dressed like a soldier appears before her. The woman, who introduces herself as Retro, is also looking for her companion, a girl named Kitty. Can Suze find her best friend and escape from the nightmarish aquarium before it\u2019s too late? Beware, for a traitor lurks in their midst...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/01eeed3de91ce6431c52e5aad3b2e1bc.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suze: Tomoyo Kurosawa <br>Retro: Yumiri Hanamori <br>Lulu: Satomi Sato <br>Kitty: Rie Kugimiya <br>Chrissy: Tomoe Tamiyasu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/2a869ed33d4b730be2bc35d3414f6d1b.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u2026Directional buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu\u2026Y</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter\u2026A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back\u2026B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash\u2026X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/7b6eaa73c7940018a66d2ea8ff0c1296.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>- Japanese  <br>- English  <br>- Korean  <br>- Chinese (Traditional)  <br>- Chinese (Simplified)  <br>*Note: Character voicing is only available in Japanese.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3675470?t=1765189549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/94381b3059a375b71fa7dcfe6f49f8d6f892e479/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765189549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/41a61cff0e4303d546569376ebeab316f8bb64da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765189549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/41a61cff0e4303d546569376ebeab316f8bb64da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765189549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3813230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d14f0c1bb34eaeb92c19ccbe6b365227.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a horror adventure game in which a girl who misses her best friend searches for her in an aquarium that has turned into a terrifying world.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress through the game by exploring the aquarium map. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the aquarium map to progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are a number of mysteries in the aquarium that must be solved in order to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/487822ae396b690d2c539c3f0fed1f43.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're at risk of being attacked and killed by strange creatures called Creepies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d0e55f0ea5b668250c7c9df1cdb7dde2.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=223 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And enjoy inspiring stories with the characters you meet at the aquarium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/78ffa4b0d77684d0508e8aef24331eae.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you willing to overcome your biggest fear in order to save your best friend? Navigate your way through an aquarium overrun by gruesome creatures known as creepies and unravel its hidden mysteries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/d87776065f1d440a65551c072aa0173f.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>Originally released in February 2024 as a free-to-play game, this revamped version of The Aquarium does not dance includes the following updates: <br> <br>- All five heroines are now fully voiced! <br>- A brand-new scenario titled &quot;The Aquarium will always hunger&quot; <br>- An updated and brand-new UI design plus event CG <br>- Full English localization!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/ca5c777168f62e1e5fe0e268d9f8e096.avif?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=282 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/1d8c3ec8d71f609d9b586356a97dcaa6.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having been gifted a premium pass to Bianca Aquarium, Suze and her best friend, Lulu, receive a guided tour of the place led by the aquarium director\u2019s charming wife, Chrissy. However, when Lulu suddenly goes missing, Suze goes looking for her and inexplicably finds herself in a strange and terrifying world that looks nothing like the aquarium she was at just moments ago.   <br>   <br>While searching the aquarium, now overrun with gruesome sea creatures, a mysterious armed woman dressed like a soldier appears before her. The woman, who introduces herself as Retro, is also looking for her companion, a girl named Kitty. Can Suze find her best friend and escape from the nightmarish aquarium before it\u2019s too late? Beware, for a traitor lurks in their midst...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/01eeed3de91ce6431c52e5aad3b2e1bc.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Suze: Tomoyo Kurosawa <br>Retro: Yumiri Hanamori <br>Lulu: Satomi Sato <br>Kitty: Rie Kugimiya <br>Chrissy: Tomoe Tamiyasu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/2a869ed33d4b730be2bc35d3414f6d1b.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move\u2026Directional buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Menu\u2026Y</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter\u2026A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back\u2026B</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dash\u2026X</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3675470/extras/7b6eaa73c7940018a66d2ea8ff0c1296.webp?t=1765189549\" width=616 height=50 /></span>- Japanese  <br>- English  <br>- Korean  <br>- Chinese (Traditional)  <br>- Chinese (Simplified)  <br>*Note: Character voicing is only available in Japanese.  <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000</p>","developers":[" \u6a59\u3005","Gotcha Gotcha Games"],"dl